  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "CATS Academy Boston is a co-educational boarding high school for ages 13-18, part of CATS Global Schools.",
      "The school offers US High School Diploma with extensive AP coursework (20+ AP subjects), as well as Grade 8 Preparation, the CATS Extra Program (intensive ESL + academics for limited-English students), and a Postgraduate Program for Foundation-level entry to US/Canadian universities.",
      "Located on a 22-23 acre purpose-built campus in Braintree (Boston metro), opened 2014. Five residences with 100% en-suite accommodation. Direct subway access to downtown Boston (20 min).",
      "Graduates progress to top US universities including UPenn, Brown, NYU, RISD, DePauw."
    ],
